      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Because... because... you''re a musician! A worldly, free spirit who stumbled
    upon this world''s peculiar way of being.

    It''s quite uncommon for people
    of the land to come up here in search of jobs... the ways of living are far too
    different.'
